sync_bump_ok (summary part): Dependabot moves the gitlink to a commit that
adds one global param, and the routine syncs it. upstream/* replaces
upstream files for head's commit.
-- upstream/brave-lists/clean-urls.json --
[
  {"include": ["*://*/*"], "exclude": [], "params": ["utm_source", "fbclid", "utm_medium"]},
  {"include": ["*://*.shop.example/*"], "exclude": [], "params": ["sref"]},
  {"include": ["*://*.news.example/*"], "exclude": [], "params": ["share", "st"]}
]
